Parents, too.

1188
00:46:27.875 --> 00:46:29.666
Can you split
friends and work?

1189
00:46:37.000 --> 00:46:38.291
25 people.

1190
00:46:38.458 --> 00:46:39.541
Add 'em to the board.

1191
