Come on, Nic, who was it?

1192
00:46:46.958 --> 00:46:48.041
(Chris chuckles wearily)

1193
00:46:48.208 --> 00:46:50.166
Well, I guess he was right.

1194
00:46:50.333 --> 00:46:51.666
-(Maddox) Who?
-(Chris) Burke.

1195
00:46:52.208 --> 00:46:53.416
If I'd been there for her,

1196
